<title>PHILIPPINES: Davao sets record date for 25 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Davao sets record date for 25 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davao Union Cement Corp said on Wednesday it had set December 24 as the record date for its 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend amounting to 250 million shares, with par value of one peso per share, was declared by the board on August 15 and approved by shareholders on October 30, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
